Don't clobber irqfd routing type when deassigning irqfd {CVE-2026-23198}\n- nvmet-tcp: add bounds checks in nvmet_tcp_build_pdu_iovec {CVE-2026-23112}\n- usb: typec: ucsi: Handle incorrect num_connectors capability {CVE-2025-71108}\n- KVM: x86: Fix VM hard lockup after prolonged inactivity with periodic HV timer {CVE-2025-71104}\n- drm/ttm: Avoid NULL pointer deref for evicted BOs {CVE-2025-71083}\n- amba: bus: fix refcount leak {CVE-2023-54230}\n- exfat: use kvmalloc_array/kvfree instead of kmalloc_array/kfree {CVE-2023-54194}\n- octeontx2-af: Add validation for lmac type {CVE-2023-54129}\n- rcu: dump vmalloc memory info safely {CVE-2023-54113}\n- wifi: rtw88: use work to update rate to avoid RCU warning {CVE-2023-54071}\n- bpf: fix a memory leak in the LRU and LRU_PERCPU hash maps {CVE-2023-54033}\n- ASoC: soc-compress: Reposition and add pcm_mutex {CVE-2023-53866}\n- netlink: do not hard code device address lenth in fdb dumps {CVE-2023-53863}\n- md/raid5-cache: fix a deadlock in r5l_exit_log() {CVE-2023-53848}\n- tpm: tpm_tis: Add the missed acpi_put_table() to fix memory leak {CVE-2022-50824}\n- net: stmmac: fix possible memory leak in stmmac_dvr_probe() {CVE-2022-50663}\n- bpf: Fix reference state management for synchronous callbacks {CVE-2022-50650}\n- blk-mq: fix tags leak when shrink nr_hw_queues {CVE-2023-54227}\n- usbnet: Run unregister_netdev() before unbind() again {CVE-2022-49501}\n- scsi: core: Wake up the error handler when final completions race against each other {CVE-2026-23110}\n- scsi: core: Move scsi_host_busy() out of host lock for waking up EH handler\n- perf/core: Prevent VMA split of buffer mappings {CVE-2025-38563}\n- Bluetooth: L2CAP: Fix accepting multiple L2CAP_ECRED_CONN_REQ {CVE-2026-23395}\n- Bluetooth: L2CAP: Fix responding with wrong PDU type\n- netfilter: nf_tables: release flowtable after rcu grace period on error {CVE-2026-23392}",
